WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.747
It was Christmas Eve.

2
00:00:01.748 --> 00:00:07.068
Fritz, Marie, and their godfather were sitting next to the Christmas tree.

3
00:00:07.069 --> 00:00:11.815
"Godfather, what's that present?" asked Fritz curiously.

4
00:00:11.816 --> 00:00:15.845
Fritz pointed to a very big red-and-green box.

5
00:00:15.846 --> 00:00:21.111
"Open it and see," replied their godfather.

6
00:00:21.112 --> 00:00:23.520
Fritz and Marie opened their gift.

7
00:00:23.521 --> 00:00:27.058
It was an old wooden nutcracker shaped like a man.

8
00:00:27.059 --> 00:00:31.115
"He's kind of ugly," said Fritz, disappointed.

9
00:00:31.116 --> 00:00:35.359
The nutcracker's legs were too short and his head was too big.

10
00:00:35.360 --> 00:00:40.658
"This nutcracker wasn't always ugly," said Godfather.

11
00:00:40.659 --> 00:00:44.373
"I like this funny-looking nutcracker," said Marie.

12
00:00:44.374 --> 00:00:45.912
"What happened to him?"

13
00:00:45.913 --> 00:00:53.816
"Once upon a time," Godfather began, "there was a king and a queen who lived in a palace.

14
00:00:53.817 --> 00:01:00.448
The queen was in the kitchen, when suddenly a very large mouse burst in.

15
00:01:00.449 --> 00:01:05.685
It was not any ordinary mouse but the queen of the mice.

16
00:01:05.686 --> 00:01:10.258
The Mouse Queen squeaked, 'Queen, may I have some bacon?'

17
00:01:10.259 --> 00:01:13.500
The kind queen replied, 'Of course.'

18
00:01:13.501 --> 00:01:15.683
But the Mouse Queen was cunning.

19
00:01:15.684 --> 00:01:19.108
She quickly called all her family and friends.

20
00:01:19.109 --> 00:01:24.829
Hundreds of mice filled the kitchen. The mice ate everything in sight.

21
00:01:24.830 --> 00:01:29.663
The queen tried to chase them away, but there were too many.

22
00:01:29.664 --> 00:01:31.781
She ran out screaming.

23
00:01:31.782 --> 00:01:36.807
Later the king ordered mousetraps to be set all around the palace.

24
00:01:36.808 --> 00:01:42.447
All of the mice, except for the Mouse Queen, died in the mousetraps.

25
00:01:42.448 --> 00:01:46.307
The Mouse Queen was furious at the king and the queen.

26
00:01:46.308 --> 00:01:48.231
All the mice were dead.

27
00:01:48.232 --> 00:01:54.917
That night, when the king and queen were eating, the Mouse Queen jumped onto the table.

28
00:01:54.918 --> 00:02:01.564
She shrieked at them, 'When you have a baby, I will take my revenge!'

29
00:02:01.565 --> 00:02:09.362
Later, when Princess Perlipat was born, everyone was overjoyed― everyone except the queen.

30
00:02:09.363 --> 00:02:12.439
She was afraid of the Mouse Queen's revenge.

31
00:02:12.440 --> 00:02:18.006
For ten years eight nurses and eight cats guarded the princess day and night.

32
00:02:18.007 --> 00:02:24.671
Meanwhile the Mouse Queen had a son of her own, but she never forgot her plan of revenge.

33
00:02:24.672 --> 00:02:31.349
One night, when the nurses and cats were sleeping, the Mouse Queen snuck into the nursery.

34
00:02:31.350 --> 00:02:36.560
She whispered a magic spell and the beautiful princess became ugly.

35
00:02:36.561 --> 00:02:45.323
The princess' head became larger than her body, and her mouth grew until it was the largest part of her face.

36
00:02:45.324 --> 00:02:51.253
The king and queen were very upset, so the king asked his wise men for help.

37
00:02:51.254 --> 00:02:54.380
They agreed there was only one solution.

38
00:02:54.381 --> 00:02:59.001
The king must find a nut made out of solid gold.

39
00:02:59.002 --> 00:03:10.625
The wise men also told the king to find a handsome nutcracker man: 'The nutcracker must open the golden nut and give it to the princess.

40
00:03:10.626 --> 00:03:14.511
Then he must take seven steps backwards.

41
00:03:14.512 --> 00:03:18.798
When he does, the Mouse Queen's spell will be broken.'

42
00:03:18.799 --> 00:03:27.204
The king's men searched everywhere, and eventually they returned with a golden nut and a nutcracker man.

43
00:03:27.205 --> 00:03:35.393
The king looked at the nutcracker and said, 'Nutcracker, if you break the magic spell, I will give you my kingdom.

44
00:03:35.394 --> 00:03:39.722
If Princess Perlipat wishes, she may marry you.'

45
00:03:39.723 --> 00:03:45.859
The nutcracker man did not answer. He only stared ahead.

46
00:03:45.860 --> 00:03:51.593
The king's men carried the nutcracker and the golden nut into the princess' room.

47
00:03:51.594 --> 00:03:55.268
Many people watched as the nutcracker cracked the nut.

48
00:03:55.269 --> 00:04:02.398
He gave it to the princess, closed his eyes, and started to walk seven steps backward.

49
00:04:02.399 --> 00:04:07.807
Suddenly there was a loud gasp, but the nutcracker kept his eyes closed.

50
00:04:07.808 --> 00:04:09.918
The Mouse Queen had appeared.

51
00:04:09.919 --> 00:04:14.512
Her eyes glittered with anger as she glared at the nutcracker.

52
00:04:14.513 --> 00:04:22.932
The nutcracker was just about to take his seventh step when the Mouse Queen stuck out her bony leg and tripped him.

53
00:04:22.933 --> 00:04:29.465
The nutcracker stumbled and fell, but as he fell, his sword cut the Mouse Queen's neck.

54
00:04:29.466 --> 00:04:36.401
She shrieked in pain and cried out, 'This spell has changed because the nutcracker man has fallen.

55
00:04:36.402 --> 00:04:43.178
The princess will become beautiful, but the nutcracker will be ugly instead.'"

